  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 74,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "but first I want to tell you why I'm here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C54FAFC9A0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "I'm here for two reasons.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79E5F3025F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "These two guys are my two sons Ford and Wren.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93035DFE54",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "When Ford was about three years old, we shared a very small room together, in a very small space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4617BF60A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "My office was on one half of the bedroom, and his bedroom was on the other half.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B5B5E6FD8C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "if you're a writer",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "50F6521141",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "things would get really crowded",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B1085F90B3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "So when Wren was on the way, I realized I needed to find a space of my own.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B95E2F283D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "There was no more space in the house.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7CDDF0B246",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "So I went out to the backyard, and without any previous building experience, and about 3,000 dollars and some recycled materials, I built this space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9AD3CDEC40",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "It had everything I needed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F611B09009",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "It was quiet.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4E634CDB91",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "There was enough space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BFC667FEF5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "And I had control, which was very important.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FE813756A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 96,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "carved out a space for his own",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "66F424AC8F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 52,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "Surely I'm not the only guy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "13E6242D3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "So I did some research.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD6FF5B091",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "And I found that there was an historic precedence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B4D9C4D0A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "Hemingway had his writing space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "786FCC880A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "Elvis had two or three manspaces, which is pretty unique because he lived with both his wife and his mother in Graceland.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "20A1CB9190",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 24,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "Superman had the Fortress of Solitude",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "71669FA932",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 89,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "the Batcave",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C4EA7F60C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "So I realized then that I wanted to go out on a journey and see what guys were creating for themselves now.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2B654CDF8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Here is one of the first spaces I found.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ED395C51F3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "It is in Austin, Texas, which is where I'm from.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F021E39BC7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "On the outside it looks like a very typical garage, a nice garage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C7581148C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "But on the inside, it's anything but.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ADDF76248B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "And this, to me, is a pretty classic manspace.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7DA50B7401",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "It has neon concert posters, a bar and, of course, the leg lamp, which is very important.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "934C5E3F4D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "I soon realized that manspaces didn't have to be only inside.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AD3EE519EB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "This guy built a bowling alley in his backyard, out of landscaping timbers, astroturf.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE0973283A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "And he found the scoreboard in the trash.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B82F320929",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "Here's another outdoor space, a little bit more sophisticated.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93067A9A7D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "This a 1923 wooden tugboat, made completely out of Douglas fir.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ABB4D920FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "The guy did it all himself.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "53737D86D7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "And there is about 1,000 square feet of hanging-out space inside.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B1DD7A19E9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 130,
        "endOffset": 200,
        "text": "a lot of beer can pyramids and overstuffed couches and flat-screen TVs",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "05888B5D68",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "So, pretty early on in my investigations I realized what I was finding was not what I expected to find, which was, quite frankly, ",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FAD128E88C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "There were definitely hang-out spots.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "37459B33D9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "some were for working, some were for playing, some were for guys to collect their things",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C7CC9DF3D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "Most of all, I was just surprised with what I was finding.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7562BE7615",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "Take this place for example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A5F2B28300",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "On the outside it looks like a typical northeastern garage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5BA9C2BC74",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "This is in Long Island, New York.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "341F1DB438",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "tip you off",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8BAAAFEDA0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "The only thing that might ",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C56ECD7436",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 19,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "a recreation of a 16th century Japanese tea house",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "23486B986A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "The man imported all the materials from Japan, and he hired a Japanese carpenter to build it in the traditional style.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A3E95038B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "It has no nails or screws.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBB1990DAF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "All the joints are hand-carved and hand-scribed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA5C5E8EB0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "Here is another pretty typical scene.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "45474B0BE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "This is a suburban Las Vegas neighborhood.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1557252B52",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 41,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "there is a professional-size boxing ring inside",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8A8D76908",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "you open one of the garage doors",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "57CA5A6A9B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E636B2FF91",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "It was built by this man who is Wayne McCullough.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9F7E7F3D4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "He won the silver medal for Ireland in the 1992 Olympics, and he trains in this space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2516564AB4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "He trains other people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D174D004A6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 73,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "bask in his accomplishments",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0449DFD564",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 159,
        "text": "And right off the garage he has his own trophy room where he can sort of bask in his accomplishments, which is another sort of important part about a manspace.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F8956AE9E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 73,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "represents a passion",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B0DFB8A1C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "represents someone's profession",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BE4A43E72",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "It's made to look like the inside of an English sailing ship.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60CEE0E340",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "It's a collection of nautical antiques from the 1700s and 1800s.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "964371EC4A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Museum quality.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9194521E8D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "So, as I came to the end of my journey, I found over 50 spaces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1F136D62F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "And they were unexpected and they were surprising.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E33AD0AB5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "But they were also -- I was really impressed by how personalized they were, and how much work went into them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB60CEF9D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "And I realized that's because the guys that I met were all very passionate about what they did.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A55FB8C52",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "And they really loved their professions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CA2DBCEF3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "And they were very passionate about their collections and their hobbies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "453673FB23",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "And so they created these spaces to reflect what they love to do, and who they were.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B5B42AB506",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "So if you don't have a space of your own, I highly recommend finding one, and getting into it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68B61DB301",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "Thank you very much.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1023E3D8A4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
